ASK "Describe the bug and how to reproduce it." AS report
IF @report is an empty string
    RETURN "A bug report is required."

DO Investigate @report in the current project.
    Record the evidence, likely cause, and any uncertainty. AS diagnosis

IF @diagnosis cannot identify a cause supported by evidence
    PRINT Explain what is missing from @diagnosis and what to investigate next.
    RETURN "More evidence is needed before proposing a fix."

DO Propose the smallest fix supported by @diagnosis. AS proposal
PRINT @proposal

ASK "Apply this fix? Type yes to approve." AS approval
IF @approval is not exactly "yes"
    RETURN "No fix was applied."

DO Apply only the approved fix in @proposal. AS change
DO Run the existing checks relevant to @change and record their actual results. AS verification
PRINT Summarize @change and @verification, including any remaining gaps.
